description: "Request an app installation: createAppInstallationRequest in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`POST /v1/installation-requests`

Authenticates a registered app backend using a short-lived signed client assertion. Creates request metadata only; customer approval is still required.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.system.createAppInstallationRequest(input: CreateAppInstallationRequestInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<CreateAppInstallationRequestOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.system.create_app_installation_request(input: CreateAppInstallationRequestInput) -> models.CreateAppInstallationRequestResponse
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.create_app_installation_request(body: &types::CreateAppInstallationRequestRequest).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::CreateAppInstallationRequestResponse>, Error<CreateAppInstallationRequestError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon();
const result = await photon.system.createAppInstallationRequest({
  body: {
    appId: "appId",
    clientAssertion: "clientAssertion",
    redirectUri: "redirectUri",
    state: "state",
  },
});
```

```python Python
from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import CreateAppInstallationRequestInput

photon = Photon()
result = photon.system.create_app_installation_request(
    CreateAppInstallationRequestInput.model_validate({
        "body": {
            "appId": "appId",
            "clientAssertion": "clientAssertion",
            "redirectUri": "redirectUri",
            "state": "state",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::PhotonClientBuilder;

let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new().build()?;
let result = client
    .create_app_installation_request(
        &serde_json::from_value(serde_json::json!({
            "appId": "appId",
            "clientAssertion": "clientAssertion",
            "redirectUri": "redirectUri",
            "state": "state",
        }))?,
    )
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

